Subject: [202605] Enable Edgecore AS7326 VXLAN SDK configuration

Apply the nine VXLAN/RIOT settings selected by Edgecore for this exact HwSKU.
AS7326 does not opt into the upstream Broadcom common-profile merge, so these
settings are absent from its loaded SDK configuration. Preserve Edgecore's
4096 overlay-interface allocation rather than the common TD3 profile's 8192.
Keep this scoped to AS7326; do not enable the entire shared profile or change
port mappings, aliases, MMU settings or unrelated SDK resource policies.

Vendor source: https://github.com/edge-core/sonic-buildimage/blob/d39662e996c0e8748c9b96ad88dc5f5f524e8048/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as7326_56x-r0/Accton-AS7326-56X/td3-as7326-48x25G+8x100G.config.bcm
Verified upstream: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.
Remove or reconcile when upstream AS7326 supplies an equivalent VXLAN profile.

These exact values match the vendor file. VXLAN forwarding and the resulting
resource/stable-cache requirements still need validation with SAI 15.2.

--- a/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as7326_56x-r0/Accton-AS7326-56X/td3-as7326-48x25G+8x100G.config.bcm
+++ b/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as7326_56x-r0/Accton-AS7326-56X/td3-as7326-48x25G+8x100G.config.bcm
@@ -33,6 +33,17 @@
 skip_L2_USER_ENTRY=0
 bcm_tunnel_term_compatible_mode=1
 l3_alpm_ipv6_128b_bkt_rsvd=1
+
+# VXLAN settings from Edgecore's AS7326 platform configuration.
+l3_ecmp_levels=2
+use_all_splithorizon_groups=1
+riot_enable=1
+sai_tunnel_support=1
+riot_overlay_l3_intf_mem_size=4096
+riot_overlay_l3_egress_mem_size=32768
+riot_overlay_ecmp_resilient_hash_size=16384
+flow_init_mode=1
+host_as_route_disable=1
 
 dport_map_port_1=6
 dport_map_port_2=2
